tion of both the classes (0 and 1). Used the following modules in Python-Pandas, NumPy, Scikit-Learn, matplotlib, Imbalanced-learn Logistic Regression gave AUC=0.95, but the precision was very low (0.08). So, I tried Random Forests and it gave AUC=0.94 and precision=0.85 (with 'gini' criterion) and AUC=0.92 & precision=0.83 (with 'entropy' criterion). Measured performance metrics-accuracy, precision, recall, AUC and plotted ROC curve Used the following modules in Python-Pandas, NumPy, Scikit-Learn, matplotlib, Imbalanced-learn","topics":[],"score":235060,"global_rank":94944},{"name":"FRC-2928/FRC-2928-ML-Files","owner":"FRC-2928","html_url":"https://github.com/FRC-2928/FRC-2928-ML-Files","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":5,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"This repository contains intermediate files required to train a deep learning model.  The purpose is to be able to share these files with other FRC teams.","topics":[],"score":235060,"global_rank":94945},{"name":"darshit-desai/A-star-algorithm-implementation-on-turtlebot","owner":"darshit-desai","html_url":"https://github.com/darshit-desai/A-star-algorithm-implementation-on-turtlebot","stars":0,"forks":1,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"An implementation of A* on turtlebot which is than simulated in ROS and Gazebo","topics":[],"score":235057,"global_rank":94950},{"name":"marinednadude/NOAA-Technical-Portal-test","owner":"marinednadude","html_url":"https://github.com/marinednadude/NOAA-Technical-Portal-test","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":2,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Test for NOAA technical portal","topics":[],"score":235056,"global_rank":94952},{"name":"prb/mounties-activity-publisher","owner":"prb","html_url":"https://github.com/prb/mounties-activity-publisher","stars":0,"forks":1,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Discord publisher for Mountaineers.org activity feeds.","topics":[],"score":235051,"global_rank":94965},{"name":"Zuriahn-Yu